//iti niyogakāṇḍas tṛtīyaḥ //

[kks_156]

// caturthaḥ (siddhi)kāṇḍaḥ //

evaṃ tāvatpratipattikartavyatāprāmāṇyavyājena yairaprāmāṇyamuktaṃ tatpratibodhanāya kṛtaḥ prayatnaḥ; idānīṃ tvaprāmāṇyamevāhurye tadbodhanāya prayatyate / tatra pūrvapakṣaḥ ---

nanvanvitapadārthatvādvākyārthasya padārthatām /
aprāpya na syādvākyārthaḥ padārthatve 'nyamānakaḥ
